            "notes": "## Round 3 is where this build begins to shine!\n\nYou now gain access to [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) and [Blink Boosts](item_9bac3119-781b-4dc0-94fa-9c293c02dc90) which means you're going to have a lot harass and fighting power. \n\nCombining the above with [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) makes you into a really powerful 1v1 machine.  \n\nYou still output great heals, so don't tunnel vision on pure DPS - keep your allies topped up too!",
