            "notes": "## Round 4 brings online either [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) or [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b). \n\nEither one of these is fine, but I much prefer [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) as I find that it helps with both my healing and damage output, more so than [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) at this stage",
